<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: 17 October 2026</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow md">
<p>Donums Consultants (“Donums”, “we”) respects your privacy. This policy explains what personal information we collect through our website and platform, why we collect it, and the choices you have. It is written to align with the Kenya Data Protection Act, 2019.</p>
<h2>Information we collect</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Service requests and enquiries:</strong> your name, contact details, location and the details you provide.</li>
<li><strong>Accounts:</strong> name, email address, password (stored only as a one-way hash), optional profile details.</li>
<li><strong>Learning:</strong> enrolments, lesson progress, quiz results, reviews and certificates.</li>
<li><strong>Careers:</strong> application details, CVs and cover letters, screening answers, interview notes and assessment outcomes.</li>
<li><strong>Community and live sessions:</strong> posts you publish, registration details, attendance and chat or Q&amp;A messages you send during sessions.</li>
<li><strong>Payments:</strong> payment references and M-Pesa or bank confirmation details you submit so that we can verify a payment. We do not store card numbers.</li>
<li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address and basic device information, used for security and abuse prevention.</li></ul>
<h2>How we use it</h2>
<p>We use personal information to deliver the service you asked for, manage your account, verify payments, assess job applications, run sessions, keep the platform secure, and communicate with you about your requests. We send marketing email only to people who have opted in, and every marketing message includes an unsubscribe link.</p>
<h2>Who sees your information</h2>
<p>Access is restricted to authorised Donums staff who need it. Job applications are visible to our recruitment team and, where we are hiring on behalf of an employer, to that employer. We share information with service providers only to the extent needed to fulfil your request. We do not sell personal information.</p>
<h2>Retention and security</h2>
<p>We keep information only as long as it is needed for the purpose it was collected, or as required by law. Uploaded CVs and payment proofs are stored in a private, access-controlled location. We use encryption for sensitive credentials, permission checks on every private file, and audit logs for administrative actions. No online system is perfectly secure, so please use a strong, unique password.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You may ask to access, correct, export or delete your personal information, to object to certain processing, or to withdraw consent at any time. Email <a href="mailto:<?= e(cfg('email')) ?>"><?= e(cfg('email')) ?></a> and we will respond within a reasonable time. You also have the right to complain to the Office of the Data Protection Commissioner.</p>
<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>We use a small number of essential cookies to keep you signed in and protect forms from forgery. We do not use advertising cookies.</p>
